1- Delete the translation file from DB with MONGO CLI. Example for pt-BR:

db.translations.deleteMany({lang:"pt-BR"})

2- Edit the JSON file located in this directory

3- Upload the file 

mongoimport -h=localhost:30998 -u=admin -p=abc123 --authenticationDatabase admin -d=guia_edutec -c=translations ./pt-BR.json --jsonArray
